            "bf_studies_label": "*See the studies",
            "bf_footnote": "<p>*Giordano et al. 2011: 80 postmenopausal women with metabolic syndrome, 4g myo-inositol daily plus diet for 6 months; HOMA-IR fell 75% in the myo-inositol group, significantly more than with diet alone. Santamaria et al. 2012: same design over 12 months; 8 of 40 women no longer met metabolic syndrome criteria vs 1 of 40 on placebo. Genazzani et al. 2008 and Artini et al. 2013: overweight women with PCOS, 2g myo-inositol daily for 12 weeks; insulin and testosterone significantly reduced. Results in studies may not reflect individual outcomes.</p>",
