            "bf_tier_1_link_tier": "2",
            "bf_tier_1_study_title": "What 3 months looked like in the research",
            "bf_tier_1_study_text": "<p>Women with PCOS took myo-inositol daily for 12 weeks. Insulin and testosterone both fell significantly. The control group saw no change.<br/><br/>Genazzani et al., 2008 · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/09513590801893232\">Read the study</a><br/>Artini et al., 2013 · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3109/09513590.2012.743020\">Read the study</a></p>",
