            "bf_tier_2_title": "6-Month Bundle",
            "bf_tier_2_badge": "6-month trial",
            "bf_tier_2_badge_style": "navy",
            "bf_tier_2_note": "6 months is what the clinical trial used. Insulin resistance fell 75%*",
            "bf_tier_2_link_text": "",
            "bf_tier_2_link_tier": "3",
            "bf_tier_2_study_title": "What 6 months looked like in the research",
            "bf_tier_2_study_text": "<p>80 women with metabolic syndrome, all showing insulin resistance, took 4g of inositol a day alongside diet. The same daily amount as two scoops of Bodology®.</p><p>After 6 months, insulin resistance fell 75% in the inositol group, far more than placebo. Blood pressure, triglycerides and HDL cholesterol improved too.&nbsp;<br/><br/>Giordano et al., 2011 · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1097/gme.0b013e3181e8e1b1\">Read the study</a></p>",
            "bf_tier_2_footnote": "*Giordano et al., 2011 (Menopause): 80 postmenopausal women with metabolic syndrome. Results in studies may not reflect individual outcomes. Trial did not involve Bodology® products. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.",
