          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>I have gone more than 3 months without my period. I started taking bodology inositol on 07/22/2026 the day after I received the product, and just 2 weeks and a few days later on 08/08/26 <strong>I got my menstrual period.</strong> I couldn’t believe it. This is an incredible product...</p>",
