          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "My doctor suggested adding it to my plan",
            "text": "<p>My doctor suggested adding it to my plan after noticing my insulin levels were high (HOMA-IR 3.8). It has helped stabilize my insulin levels, improved my energy and eased several of my PCOS symptoms including my irregular cycles!</p>",
